//
// What plays — the one media state the design mirrors in three places: the
// Activity Runner in the top bar, the taskbar's mini player and the touch
// dock's small player (design artifacts: TaskbarDock, ActivityRunner).
//
// NO MEDIA SESSION YET. Nothing feeds the shell a now-playing state, so
// nothing plays: the island and both mini players are not drawn (an island
// with demo art would claim music that is not there). The players keep the
// design's demo track copy (`shell.trackTitle` / `shell.trackArtist`) for the
// day a session lands — its effect then sets this field, and the title,
// artist, artwork and play state join it here.

Store MediaStore {
    nowPlaying: Bool = false,
}
